Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "These caves are crawling with monsters... But
we have to get through them to find Zelda.",
  "1.0.1.0" => "That's the exit over there. Though we'll have
to take the long way around from the north...",
  "1.0.2.0" => "The Hyrulean soldiers have marched toward
the exit. Link, let's rendezvous with them.",
  "1.0.3.0" => "There's lava blocking the way, and monsters
have shown up! We're gonna get wiped out!",
  "1.0.4.0" => "Monsters? Link and I will be right there.
Stay alive until we can get to you!",
  "1.0.5.0" => "General Impa! You've arrived!",
  "1.0.6.0" => "Excellent. Link should be joining us here
before long.",
  "1.0.7.0" => "These caves... No matter how many monsters
we cut down, more keep coming out!",
  "1.0.8.0" => "The monsters must be originating from a keep.
Link, find the source and shut it down!",
  "1.0.9.0" => "Link, have you discovered the keep?",
  "1.0.10.0" => "Well done. But the job is unfinished. Monsters
are still spawning from other keeps.",
  "1.0.11.0" => "The number of monsters is diminishing!
We can finally do something!",
  "1.0.12.0" => "There are just too many monsters!
We can't hold out on our own!",
  "1.0.13.0" => "This is bad... Link, get here quick!",
  "1.0.14.0" => "Reinforcements are here!
Oh, thank goodness!",
  "1.0.15.0" => "We have to fall back!
There are just too many!",
  "1.0.16.0" => "We're too late... Forgive us...",
  "1.0.17.0" => "That lava is stopping our progress.
We need to do something about it!",
  "1.0.18.0" => "Hmm... If we break those stone spires,
maybe we can get across the lava!",
  "1.0.19.0" => "We'll help! Rocks are no match for a good ol'
Bombchu!",
  "1.0.21.0" => "Yes, that would be great! Please hurry!",
  "1.0.22.0" => "Hiya ha ha! Getting you into these caves was
so simple! Now they shall become your tomb!",
  "1.0.23.0" => "Destroy that eyesore of a rat!
Show these fools the depths of despair!",
  "1.0.24.0" => "They're going after our Bombchu!",
  "1.0.25.0" => "Link! Guard the Bombchu!",
  "1.0.26.0" => "There are too many monsters... The Bombchu
can't move unless some space is cleared!",
  "1.0.27.0" => "Then I'll just have to cut a swath through the
enemies to help the Bombchu reach the stone.",
  "1.0.28.0" => "So many monsters... It'd have been smarter
to take control of the spawning keeps first!",
  "1.0.29.0" => "The Bombchu can't move forward until that
gate is open!",
  "1.0.30.0" => "Link, I can't reach that keep at the moment!
I need you to take care of it for me!",
  "1.0.31.0" => "Great! Now the Bombchu can reach the
stone!",
  "1.0.32.0" => "Excellent, Link! Now we can proceed!",
  "1.0.33.0" => "Head for the exit! Like we've been trying
to do all this time!",
  "1.0.34.0" => "Hurry, Link! We're marching on!",
  "1.0.35.0" => "Oh no... The Bombchu has been destroyed!",
  "1.0.36.0" => "It's OK! We've got more of 'em!
We'll just launch another one!",
  "1.0.37.0" => "This is the last Bombchu in this keep.
Guard it extra closely!",
  "1.0.38.0" => "Without the Bombchu, we're stuck...
We have to keep that Bombchu safe!",
  "1.0.39.0" => "Forward! Cut them down! Hiya ha ha!",
  "1.0.40.0" => "They're really getting fierce, aren't they?
C'mon. We've got to keep moving.",
  "1.0.41.0" => "The southern gate of this keep leads to the exit.
Let's capture it and be done with this cave.",
  "1.0.42.0" => "Whoa! A chest appeared! Must be a reward
for taking this keep. C'mon! Let's open it!",
  "1.0.43.0" => "Wow! I bet there's something really good
in there!",
  "1.0.44.0" => "It's too early to celebrate. The gate won't
open...",
  "1.0.45.0" => "They have nowhere to run! Crush them! Beat
them! Grind them to dust! Hiya ha ha!",
  "1.0.46.0" => "With this many enemies pouring out, I'm ready
to believe some sort of spirit is at work...",
  "1.0.47.0" => "Defeating this "Spirit" might open the exit.
Why don't you look in the deepest tunnels?",
  "1.0.48.0" => "I can guard this location while you handle
the search. Good luck!",
  "1.0.49.0" => "I'll guard our rear from oncoming enemies.
Don't worry--I'm prepared for anything...",
  "1.0.50.0" => "Link! That monster must be the Spirit of the
Caves we've been searching for!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "We have to defeat that monster.
It's our only chance of surviving!",
  "1.0.52.0" => "Link! Search the deepest tunnels!",
  "1.0.53.0" => "Well done! Now we can leave these infernal
caverns behind!",
  "1.0.54.0" => "Forgive me. This is as far as I can go.
I wish you safe travels through the caves...",
  "1.0.55.0" => "We have monsters trying to flank us! We'll
be surrounded if we don't do something...",
  "1.0.56.0" => "We have stone spires blocking our way
yet again!",
  "1.0.57.0" => "Blowing up stones is a cinch!",
  "1.0.58.0" => "We need your help once more. A Bombchu is
trapped in that keep.",
  "1.0.59.0" => "The enemies in the keep are holding up the
Bombchu! Recapture the keep right away!",
  "1.0.60.0" => "Two big stones... One Bombchu's power
won't be enough...",
  "1.0.61.0" => "One of our brothers said he left a Bombchu
in these caverns. Try looking around for it!",
  "1.0.62.0" => "I'll protect the Gorons.
You seek out the Bombchu!",
  "1.0.63.0" => "There, that's it! You found it! Now we can
blow up the other stone!",
  "1.0.64.0" => "Link! Sweep the enemies in that keep! We
must prepare the Bombchu for deployment.",
  "1.0.65.0" => "Doesn't look like it's in that keep!",
  "1.0.66.0" => "Nice one! Now we can deploy the Bombchu!",
  "1.0.67.0" => "Preparations are complete!
Deploy it, quickly!",
  "1.0.68.0" => "You got it! Launching two Bombchu!
It's a straight line to the stones!",
  "1.0.69.0" => "Always something in my way... I'll
smash these rats myself if I have to!",
  "1.0.70.0" => "Gaaah! Keep the monsters away from the 
Bombchu!",
  "1.0.71.0" => "We're ready to escape. Sheik, was it?
Join us!",
  "1.0.72.0" => "On my way.",
  "1.0.73.0" => "The first explosion was a success!",
  "1.0.74.0" => "The road should be open before long!
Cover the second Bombchu!",
  "1.0.75.0" => "Perfect! The way to the exit is clear!
Thank you, Gorons! And you too, Link!",
  "1.0.76.0" => "Hurry, Link! The exit is over here!",
  "1.0.77.0" => "Impa, are you OK? We're waiting at the exit!",
  "1.0.78.0" => "Now, to Faron Woods. I keep hearing rumors
about a woman leading a resistance there.",
  "1.0.79.0" => "I hope that woman is Princess Zelda...",
  "1.0.80.0" => "Link, Impa, well done! If we combine our
efforts, Hyrule may yet survive!",
  "1.0.81.0" => "I've failed... How can I take such a disgrace
so lightly?",
  "1.0.83.0" => "There are no more Bombchu left...",
  "1.0.84.0" => "If we have no way to break those stones,
then we're stuck.",
  "1.0.85.0" => "We're out of spare Bombchu! It's all over if
these two get destroyed!",
  "1.0.86.0" => "I think there are still some keeps spawning
monsters... Why didn't we stop those first?",
  "1.0.87.0" => "Sorry we're late! We're here to help!",
  "1.0.88.0" => "Maybe we should have taken the keeps where
all those monsters were coming from first...",
  "1.0.89.0" => "Ready for some Goron assistance?",
  "1.0.90.0" => "Hyrulean soldiers are past here, but the gates
are closed, so we're cut off from joining them...",
  "1.0.91.0" => "There has to be a way to continue forward...",
  "1.0.92.0" => "This wall looks cracked... We might be able to
destroy it somehow!",
  "1.0.93.0" => "If we capture the keep, we may be
able to stop the flow of monsters.",
  "1.0.94.0" => "Kiya ha... As long as we have a Summoner,
we'll have all the monsters we want!",
  "1.0.95.0" => "Too slow! Chase them down and commence
the pincer attack!",
  "1.0.96.0" => "I'll deal with the enemy to the east. Keep
them from the square in the tunnel!",
  "1.0.97.0" => "No...the enemy has pursued us all the
way here!",
  "1.0.98.0" => "I can't defend both at the same time!
Link! I need your help guarding one!",
  "1.0.99.0" => "More enemies, hm? Allow me to dispatch them.",
  "1.0.100.0" => "Why do they keep heading for that keep...?
There must be something there! Capture it!",
  "13.0.0.0" => "Link is ready to help, Impa! I'm sure
we'll get everyone out in one piece!",
  "13.0.1.0" => "The exit is over there, but we'll have to go
all the way around the north to get to it...",
  "13.0.2.0" => "The Hyrulean soldiers went ahead
without us! Impa, we have to catch up!",
  "13.0.3.0" => "The soldiers are in trouble!
We have to hurry!",
  "13.0.4.0" => "Thanks, kid! You really saved our hides!",
  "13.0.5.0" => "Here we are! And Impa is right behind us,
so don't worry!",
  "13.0.6.0" => "There must be a keep around here that's
spawning monsters... We should capture it!",
  "13.0.7.0" => "That's got to be the monsters' lair!",
  "13.0.8.0" => "We did it, but it looks like monsters are still
coming from another keep... Keep looking!",
  "13.0.9.0" => "Please, we need help! Quick!",
  "13.0.10.0" => "Oh no... I'm so sorry...",
  "13.0.11.0" => "Thank you! Now, why don't we let the
Bombchu do the hard part!",
  "13.0.12.0" => "We have to guard the Bombchu!",
  "13.0.13.0" => "Link! Defeat all the enemies on the way to the spire
to give the Bombchu a clear shot at blowing it up!",
  "13.0.14.0" => "Uh-oh! Link can't get to that keep...
It's all up to you, Impa!",
  "13.0.15.0" => "We weren't able to stop the monsters
from coming!",
  "13.0.16.0" => "We should've taken that monster keep first.
There are just too many monsters...",
  "13.0.17.0" => "Phew! Now the Bombchu can reach the
stone spires!",
  "13.0.18.0" => "Thank you, Impa! Let's keep going!",
  "13.0.19.0" => "No! They destroyed the Bombchu!",
  "13.0.20.0" => "We need that Bombchu to get out of the caves
and find Princess Zelda... What will we do...?",
  "13.0.21.0" => "Impa, please come quick!",
  "13.0.22.0" => "The South Gate of this keep leads to the exit.
If we capture the keep, the gate might open!",
  "13.0.23.0" => "Oh? The South Gate didn't open...
At least we captured the keep!",
  "13.0.24.0" => "Enemies are coming out of the tunnels!
Maybe the Spirit of the Caves is in there...",
  "13.0.25.0" => "Link can take that keep! He won't give up,
no matter what!",
  "13.0.26.0" => "That ghostly guy is really suspicious...
He must be the Spirit of the Caves!",
  "13.0.27.0" => "I knew you could do it, Impa!
Now we can all get out of the caves!",
  "13.0.28.0" => "The boy covering our flank has fallen.
If we do nothing, we'll be surrounded!",
  "13.0.29.0" => "Drat, more stones in our way!",
  "13.0.30.0" => "Yes! A Bombchu is exactly what we need!",
  "13.0.31.0" => "We can't launch the Bombchu with enemies in
the keep. Quick, take it back!",
  "13.0.32.0" => "Impa, we need another Bombchu! Link can
defend the Gorons while you search!",
  "13.0.33.0" => "Impa! Can you please clear that keep out?
If you do, we can use the Bombchu!",
  "13.0.34.0" => "Everyone set? Then here we go!",
  "13.0.35.0" => "Hey...uh...ninja person! We'll be out in
no time! Just come with us!",
  "13.0.36.0" => "Great! That's one out of two!",
  "13.0.37.0" => "Great, now we can get to the exit!
Thanks a lot, everyone!",
  "13.0.38.0" => "Great, now we can head into Faron Woods and
find this woman we've been hearing about!",
  "13.0.39.0" => "I hope she's Princess Zelda...",
  "13.0.40.0" => "Link, get a grip! Without the Hero, this world is
doomed...",
  "13.0.41.0" => "We can't move ahead if the stone is still here...
We should go back and rethink our strategy.",
  "13.0.42.0" => "I can hear our soldiers up ahead! But the
gates are closed, so we can't join them...",
  "13.0.43.0" => "Impa! I think there's something suspicious
down there in the caves!",
  "13.0.44.0" => "Could we do something to open the way
ahead...?",
  "13.0.45.0" => "Hey, that wall looks a bit cracked!
Maybe we can use something to destroy it...",
  "13.0.46.0" => "Hurry up, Link! The exit is here!",
  "13.0.47.0" => "Impa, are you all right? We'll be waiting at
the exit!",
  "13.0.48.0" => "Should we have taken control of the
monsters' keeps first?",
  "13.0.49.0" => "I'm sure that's where monsters
are coming from!",
  "13.0.50.0" => "Oh no! Here too!",
}